WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:14.270
Customers: one case per person: the conversation, forms, media, notes and timeline in one place. The list shows each customer's stage, tags, source and last activity.

2
00:00:14.822 --> 00:00:33.650
Search by name, username (previous names too), city, tag or case number. With the filters in the "Views & filters" box above the table, show only "Mine", "Overdue task", one source or one team member; the box's line says which filters are on now.

3
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:41.660
Click a customer to open their case: "Overview", "Conversation", "Forms", "Notes" and "Timeline".

4
00:00:42.214 --> 00:01:01.690
On the overview each part of the case is a box whose line says how it stands now; an overdue task and a receipt waiting for review come first and open. The "Follow-up" box shows the lead score and why, and the "Next step:"; "Make it a task" turns it into a task with a due time.

5
00:01:02.245 --> 00:01:15.060
Switch between "List" and "Board"; in the "Views & filters" box, keep any filtered view with "Save this view" and take it out with "Export to Excel" (a CSV file that opens in Excel).
